---
layout: default
---
<div class="post home-page">
  <section class="home-hero" aria-labelledby="home-title">
    <div class="home-hero__media">
      <video
        class="home-hero__video"
        autoplay
        muted
        loop
        playsinline
        preload="metadata"
        poster="{{ '/assets/img/hero-aerosols.jpg' | relative_url }}"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <source src="{{ '/assets/video/Aerosols_RotatingEarth_3840x2160.mp4' | relative_url }}" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <div class="home-hero__overlay">
        <p class="home-eyebrow">AEROSOLS · CLOUDS · CLIMATE</p>
        <h1 id="home-title">Welcome to Xiaotian's website</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section home-research" aria-labelledby="research-heading">
    <div class="home-section__heading">
      <h2 id="research-heading">Research Interests</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="research-grid">
      <article class="research-card">
        <p class="research-card__label">AEROSOL · PARTICLES</p>
        <h3>Aerosol Mixing State</h3>
        <p>How particle-level composition and mixing state shape aerosol optical properties, aging, and cloud-relevant behavior.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card">
        <p class="research-card__label">CLOUDS · CCN</p>
        <h3>Aerosol-Cloud Interactions</h3>
        <p>How surfactants, phase separation, and surface tension influence CCN activity and cloud droplet formation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="research-card">
        <p class="research-card__label">MODELING · DATA</p>
        <h3>Machine Learning</h3>
        <p>Connecting particle-scale understanding with regional and global models to quantify aerosol-climate effects.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- News -->
  {% if page.announcements and page.announcements.enabled %}
    <section class="home-section home-news" aria-labelledby="news-heading">
      <div class="home-section__heading">
        <h2 id="news-heading"><a href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}">News</a></h2>
        <a class="home-section__link" href="{{ '/news/' | relative_url }}">View all <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      {% include news.liquid limit=true %}
    </section>
  {% endif %}
</div>
